; Story window cursor state
;
; Column counter ($869B), cursor cell address ($869C), pixel offset of the
; cursor within its cell ($869E; 6-pixel characters straddle cells), the indent
; printed at the start of an empty line ($869F, set by #R$9FC7) and the last
; character printed on the line ($86A0, 0 = empty line). Set at the start
; ($6C8D-$6CB0) and by #R$86A1.
@label=StoryColumn
g$869B DEFB $00
@label=StoryCursor
 $869C DEFW $0000
@label=StoryCursorPixel
 $869E DEFB $00
@label=ListIndent
 $869F DEFB $00
@label=StoryLastChar
 $86A0 DEFB $00
